# Ubuntu White Sense / COMB / LF

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    F[File] --> M[Common File Metadata]
    F --> S1[Sense 1\n18 ratings + health]
    F --> S2[Sense 2 optional\n18 ratings + health]
    F --> S3[Sense 3 optional\n18 ratings + health]
    M --> H[Hold Type]
    S1 --> C[COMB]
    S2 --> C
    S3 --> C
    H --> C
    C --> I[Deterministic Inventory]
    F --> L[lf]
    M --> L
    S1 --> L
    S2 --> L
    S3 --> L
    L --> O[Common Listing / Optional Ratings]
```

